: "2024-06-06T03:26:34Z", "repo": "potterwhite.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b772a2c2ac37df958ee1e772c21c94d05d8b417", "message": "Site updated: 2024-06-06 11:14:19", "created_at": "2024-06-06T03:14:21Z", "repo": "potterwhite.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "af0bdca6085957dfdfdfdd147b908c09076ee011", "message": "Site updated: 2024-06-05 17:36:43", "created_at": "2024-06-05T09:36:45Z", "repo": "potterwhite.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f99760a9a8a184e42e10c5da565a210e1e7e9e26", "message": "First commit", "created_at": "2024-06-05T09:36:43Z", "repo": "potterwhite.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a6c23f02a4faf09e4c37cd0ae0ff41e121d6bda", "message": "refactor(pkm-templater): reorganize template structure and enhance journal system (#21)\n\n- Move all PKB templates into structured Templater plugin directory\n- Introduce clearer separation between Journal, Project, Task, and JS utilities\n- Add Daily Devotion section to DailyNote template\n- Add Journal README documentation\n- Add technical summary report template (What-is_\u603b\u7ed3\u6a21\u677f)\n- Update Weekly Review project separation configuration\n- Remove deprecated Yearly-Compnay-Review-Template\n- Normalize yearly statistics template formatting", "created_at": "2026-02-27T02:14:38Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f40a6ae90c2794c15316f6e18cd3ca320ed286fc", "message": "feat(review): improve weekly and monthly reflection and task review templates (#19)\n\n- add reflection look-back section for weekly and monthly reviews\n- extract \"\u60f3\u6cd5\u4e0e\u53cd\u601d\" from daily journals within time window\n- batch dataview rendering to avoid repeated DOM reflow\n- add one-click copy for prompt and aggregated reflections\n- refactor task time analytics with grouped project dashboards\n- align weekly and monthly templates to shared structure", "created_at": "2026-02-02T03:08:25Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6938d03560bbb0efa2ec4d4e75d2c06f0c434858", "message": "feat(templates): overhaul review system with visualization, interactivity, and performance fixes\n\nMajor upgrades to Daily, Weekly, and Yearly templates, introducing data visualization and significantly improving rendering performance.\n\nDetails:\n1. Daily Note (Interactive):\n   - Feat: Replaced static frontmatter with JS execution block.\n   - Feat: Added `tp.system.prompt` to allow custom date input (defaults to today) with auto-validation and dynamic frontmatter generation.\n\n2. Yearly & Weekly Reviews (Visualization):\n   - Feat: Integrated `ChartsView` plugin to generate Pie (weight), Column (time comparison), and Bar (ranking) charts.\n   - Perf: Optimized Column charts by limiting data to top 40 projects and using vertical text for X-axis to prevent rendering lag.\n   - Feat: Added pagination logic for Bar charts to handle long project lists across multiple pages.\n   - Perf: Rewrote \"Ideas & Reflections\" extraction in Yearly Review to use `app.metadataCache`. Skips file reading if headers are missing, reducing generation time from ~10s to <1s.\n\n3. Monthly Review:\n   - Style: Improved time formatting to show \"X min (Y hour Z min)\" instead of just minutes.\n\n4. New Template:\n   - Feat: Created `\u5e74\u5ea6\u65f6\u95f4\u7edf\u8ba1\u8868-Template.md` for manual annual reporting with interactive prompts and built-in ChartsView support.", "created_at": "2026-01-13T01:14:26Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "21945fa858d883a34dd96848c3ea6482b36ab360", "message": "fix(templates): correct DailyNote rendering logic and relocate technical template\n\n- Fix task name rendering: properly escape underscores to prevent broken markdown (em> issues).\n- Fix table columns: remove non-existent 'project' and redundant 'category' fields; replace with sanitized 'task name'.\n- Table Content: remove raw metadata (start/end/duration) from the task description column to avoid duplication.\n- Refactor: move 'TechnicalConclusion-Template.md' into the 'Templates' directory.", "created_at": "2026-01-07T01:06:57Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b96b851ce764ca8234f5941dd98282ed0d327ec0", "message": "fix(docs): replace hardcoded version badge with dynamic GitHub Releases shield\n\n- Update README to use shields.io dynamic badge.\n- Fix URL encoding for Chinese characters in badge.\n- Ensure version displays correctly from GitHub Releases.", "created_at": "2026-01-05T08:17:58Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3162688f865711ad68b9881e26b88a562abe6798", "message": "feat(templates): add Technical Conclusion template and normalize YAML lists\n\n- Add 'TechnicalConclusion-Template.md' for structured technical reporting.\n- Refactor 'project' and 'area' fields in DailyNote, Project, and Task templates to use YAML list syntax (array) instead of single strings for better Dataview/Properties compatibility.", "created_at": "2026-01-05T07:17:47Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "78f5cd3f396ac0855c1ef90719bd6a3e937357cf", "message": "chore: customize release-please configuration (#9)\n\n- Enable 'bump-minor-pre-major' to handle 0.x versions correctly\n- Add custom 'changelog-sections' with emojis (\u2728 Added, \ud83d\udc1b Fixed, etc.)\n- Fix the JSON schema key for better IDE intellisense support", "created_at": "2026-01-04T06:33:02Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59c8cdf4f623c99684dec4ae72384531e4110d47", "message": "feat(templates): add dynamic yearly company review template (#7)\n\nIntroduces a new DataviewJS-powered template for conducting yearly reviews, specifically focused on \"Company\" or other project keywords.\n\n**Features:**\n- \ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f **Dynamic Year Input**: Prompts user for the target year (defaults to current).\n- \ud83c\udfaf **Keyword Filtering**: dynamic filtering based on `area` or project names (defaults to \"Company\").\n- \ud83d\udcca **Visualizations**: Includes Pie, Column, and Bar charts for time distribution using `chartsview`.\n- \u23f1\ufe0f **Time Tracking**: Aggregates time spent per project from daily journal tasks.\n- \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Error Handling**: Graceful fallback when no data matches the filter.\n\n**File:** `VaultPARA/3_RESOURCE/PKB/Templates/Yearly-Compnay-Review-Template.md`", "created_at": "2026-01-03T06:36:05Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b7313c15eed3df5a197ea55b2d64f19a51eb499", "message": "chore: fix action name deprecation", "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:38:49Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2a6de0e86f3cdc8cabd5cc19e3ede543dd4fd58", "message": "feat: trigger first release", "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:36:08Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e54f4fb1a95d214396016caed830fdd1574579d", "message": "chore: bootstrap release-please configuration (#5)", "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:33:10Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c5086bde576c48b9ed4e03566fdc1490eb31ba0c", "message": "Merge pull request #4 from potterwhite/br_v0.2.2\n\nfeat(template): add hour/minute formatting to project summary table", "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:27:29Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ce1568cdc4e1e2481e4b85303f919d57e921657", "message": "feat(template): add hour/minute formatting to project summary table\n\nPreviously, the \"Project Total Duration\" table in the weekly summary only displayed raw minutes (e.g., \"380 minutes\"). This was difficult to interpret quickly for projects with high time investment.\n\nThis commit updates the DataviewJS logic in the `week-summary` template:\n- Implemented `Math.floor` and modulo logic to calculate hours from total minutes.\n- Updated the display string to format as `Total min (X hours Y minutes)`.\n- Added a conditional check to only apply this formatting when the duration exceeds 1 hour.\n\nRef: week-summary template", "created_at": "2025-12-30T07:05:16Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "81110b555e00b8fd20560cee658f7d808981b670", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from potterwhite/br_v0.2.1\n\nRelease 0.2.1", "created_at": "2025-12-30T06:12:49Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "523e990cf31fb723d9fd088f31931be99a36846f", "message": "Release 0.2.1\n\n- Remove deprecated Yearly-Rank-By-Day template permanently\n- Add Alt+Y shortcut for inserting Yearly Review template (documented in README)\n- Rename Yearly-Rank-By-Month.md to Yearly-Review-Template.md for clarity\n- Update CHANGELOG with new 0.2.1 entry and release link", "created_at": "2025-12-30T06:11:55Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "99838ad9292dfce43f75b7b73d6da3380b2463a9", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from potterwhite/br_v0.2.0\n\nfeat: Release v0.2.0 \u2013 Yearly Reviews, Charts Visualization & Out-of-the-Box Experience", "created_at": "2025-12-30T06:03:41Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2fe256b53d1f6e13bb5a3f2c61346b1e48c94422", "message": "feat: release v0.2.0 - yearly reviews, charts, and enhanced templates\n\n- Add two yearly review templates with detailed stats and Charts View visualizations\n- Enhance monthly review with pie/bar/column charts for project time distribution\n- Improve daily note: better yesterday task inheritance and time summary in hours+minutes\n- Upgrade weekly review: clickable links, cross-year week fix, clearer totals\n- Interactive time block insertion with task suggester and preview\n- Add essential .obsidian configs for out-of-box experience:\n  templates.json, daily-notes.json\n- Add CHANGELOG.md and update documentation\n\nMinor release with significant new review and visualization features.", "created_at": "2025-12-30T05:57:17Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b74a6de7b19ff634c6a8410ca2f3104fee700165", "message": "feat(template): enhance daily note with weekday and time summary\n\nThis commit significantly improves the daily note template by adding two key user-facing features and performing minor code cleanup.\n\n- **Weekday Display:** The note title and YAML frontmatter now automatically include the day of the week (e.g., \"Wednesday\"). This provides immediate context when viewing the note and allows for easier filtering in Dataview queries (e.g., finding all \"Monday\" notes).\n\n- **Total Time Analysis:** The 'Time Analysis' DataviewJS script is upgraded to calculate and display the total duration of all logged time blocks. This provides a clear, at-a-glance summary of the day's tracked activities.\n\n- **Code Cleanup:** The 'Today's Goals' DataviewJS block is slightly refactored by fully commenting out the unused 'Plan A', improving code clarity.", "created_at": "2025-07-29T01:28:39Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1801d7874fdf674346201dddbdff813f286825d0", "message": "fix: correct task_uuid in DailyNote-Template and enhance Task-Template with total duration\n\n- Fixed incorrect `task::` to `task_uuid::` in DailyNote-Template.md for consistency.\n- Added total duration calculation and display in Task-Template.md to improve time tracking.\n- Ensures accurate task referencing and better visibility of task duration.", "created_at": "2025-07-05T06:35:25Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f261f2121f1023f4315469180421eee065b4f97a", "message": "feat: Initial commit for Obsidian-Nexus v0.1.0-alpha\n\nThis commit introduces the foundational structure of the Obsidian-Nexus vault, a comprehensive, pre-configured system for personal knowledge management using the PARA method.\n\nIncludes:\n- Core vault structure (`VaultPARA`) with essential configuration files.\n- A full suite of templates for projects, tasks, and daily/weekly/monthly notes.\n- Documentation (`README`, `README_zh`, `AAR.md`) to guide users.", "created_at": "2025-07-04T07:13:07Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e2733f29e164e1329f6401f28a3fff3bbb90e3e8", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-07-04T02:30:50Z", "repo": "obsidian-nexus", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7d170e320416af61ea3d4f9f82398f31ea35f158", "message": "improve git-rewrite-author.sh\nsupport committer information changing\nand if without committer modification github will always show that\nauthor is correct but committer is someone you never want him or her to be here\n\n\tmodified:   bash/setup-git-rewrite-author.sh", "created_at": "2026-01-13T03:37:00Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "af94b0cb7578d78a75eb15b2da8be9bde31a0397", "message": "add convert-markdown.sh\nthis file is to convert project data field from\nnon-double-quotation-mark to the format that has.\n\n\tnew file:   bash/convert-markdown.sh", "created_at": "2026-01-09T09:02:49Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ec6fcb645755ad3dd1adb22e5f2679ce939e739", "message": "add yaml and yml in bash/add_copyright.sh\nadd convert_notion-v7.py which was been used in real environment", "created_at": "2026-01-07T01:53:22Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7db37ef108eb1ca5826a1d27646cdf2d19357708", "message": "add add_copyright.sh\nwho is using the addlicense tool from google\n\ntested on cmake-cpp repo and result success", "created_at": "2025-12-25T03:18:50Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e05c7b2bdb381fdb20532d09bcc01d44f4c14efc", "message": "Merge branch 'br_excel-converter'", "created_at": "2025-12-22T07:18:37Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5bb4d30dd60f31d056357c5e163644b0a6d085a2", "message": "\tnew file:   bash/youtube-download-best-audio.sh", "created_at": "2025-12-22T07:16:36Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "856015de135d7e41ae6ddb7bcd1fd056cad57312", "message": "fixed: COL_DURATION == 0 will be filted\n\nso we can have #millestone task now", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:42:07Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "278b05f671f1535d027e274c89d22b25f119a749", "message": "feat: add ec-v6-markwhen.py\nfixed: date calculation errors", "created_at": "2025-12-15T03:33:39Z", "repo": "UbuntuTweakTool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2026-02-27T02:14:21Z", "body_length": 454}, {"created_at": "2026-02-02T03:07:57Z", "body_length": 364},